					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							The raid on Dalnir saturday was done on the wrong day. I had a Guild Meeting set for that day. Many people where aware of it, for they added themselves to the attendee list. Please becarefull when doing raids. I often have important things to go over and was rather frustrated when this happened. <br />
<br />
Sunday, April 22, We said goodbye to a fellow officer and member to the guild. Simmond/Trapsitn had some stuff to take care of and left the guild. Everyone say good luck to him. <br />
<br />
I was notified over an argument of who is highest rank. I have designated Nukok to be second in command, And Malagar as 3rd in command. They are to be treated with the respect as if you were to be treated. They take over when i am not around and help keep guild order. <br />
<br />
Guild Raid:<br />
<br />
An officer will be the one to lead a raid. <br />
She/He will pick one person in each group to loot items. The person who is picked please be honest. Also if there is more than one group. The Raid leader will designate a person to lead each group. Any items a member needs for thier class will have the chance to gain that item first. If there is more than one class then those of the same class will random for that item. Higher level groups will not take out the lower levels kill, unless they ask for help or they have taken 60% of the mobs health. <br />
<br />
From this point on all officer will be voted to become one or voted to be dissmised. I am going to split  officers into groups. Nukok will be in charge of group 1, Malagar will be in Charge of group 2. Each officer will be in charge of a certain amount of members.<br />
I feely strongly that this guild needs a STRONG CHAIN OF COMMAND to help this guild stay orginized.<br />
<br />
A rank structure will also be added to guild. Title will follow. I will need to have a council of all officer to help me come up with this structure.<br />
<br />
Guild MOTD, If guild leader has posted on the MOTD. It takes priority over any officer MoTD. If a officer feels the need to post IMPORTANT information. They must petition to guild leader for permission to overwrite.<br />
<br />
Guild Funds, 25% of pp will be given to guild funds. I have been putting in what ever i have looted into guild fund. Few members have been gracious enough to spare pp to help guild fund. I will no longer be putting in money I personly loot while in groups, exception of raids.<br />
<br />
During a Guild meeting it is important for all guild member to give ideas to help guild. A guild is for everyone to help each other. If no one says anything during a guild meeting. Then what ever I have posted so far is final.<br />
<br />
More will be added later, and soon be put into guild rules on website. If I sound harsh, it not because I am, its because I do not want this guild to fall apart and lose stability. Most of us have worked hard to get this guild going. This guild is and made to be for people to have fun and enjoy themselves.<br />
<br />
